- Error codes.
- Group-session messages.
- Permission references.
- Version negotiation.
- Event types.
- Correlation IDs.
- Idempotency keys.
- Timestamps.
- Expiration rules.

Do not import Gateway internal source code into the Chatbot.

Do not import Chatbot internal source code into the Gateway.

If a shared package is required, publish it as a versioned package with explicit public interfaces.

