## 10.1 Required controls

- Maximum follow-up turns.
- Maximum execution duration.
- Maximum token usage.
- Maximum financial budget.
- Allowed capabilities.
- Per-request cancellation.
- Global cancellation.
- Approval thresholds.
- Loop detection.
- Repeated-question detection.
- Maximum response size.

Suggested initial default:
- Maximum five follow-up turns.
- Strict request timeout.
- Configurable cost ceiling.
- No automatic privilege escalation.

