## 10.2 Loop prevention

Prevent:
- Two AIs repeatedly asking each other the same question.
- Recursive invocation chains.
- Infinite group conversations.
- Unbounded tool calls.
- Unexpected financial consumption.

Maintain a trace of the invocation chain.

Use maximum depth, turn limits, budget checks and idempotency.

